= 1 November 1974 — A federal Cyprus in force

The implementation process that began on August 15 has been completed. The six autonomous Turkish cantons and the federal institutions established by the Güneş agreement are now fully in force.

The agreement announced on August 30 has become an operating political settlement. Turkey's military position has been turned into a lasting arrangement without a second operation.

- @root: The agreement is now a reality.
